    - target: {fileID: 3556626361776315801, guid: db5dd250aa2b61749b1a6ff35cf2445f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Each season the bells call for tribute: young warriors, criminals,
        and those who seek glory descend into its corridors. The Guardian does not
        wait; it stalks the halls, devours the unwary, and with every life it consumes
        grows stronger and more cunning'
